Endless Immortal Journey's Demo version made its debut as scheduled at today's Steam New Release Festival! We've collected a lot of player feedback and modification suggestions today, and after a day of intense work, here are the updated and fixed contents:

【New Features】
*. Added an auto-cast option;
*. Added a quick sell option for equipment;
*. Added animations at the start of battles;
*. Added level and tier information when obtaining junior and senior disciples;
*. Added prioritization of low-health targets for healing skills;
*. Added some side quests;

【Bug Fixes】
*. Fixed the issue of characters starting battles without returning to their positions;
*. Fixed the issue of the Hall of Heroes not refreshing after unlocking;
*. Fixed the issue of the Hall of Heroes not recruiting new disciples on the first day of each month;
*. Fixed the issue of buffs not being effective;
*. Fixed the issue of being unable to complete certain tasks if not accepted;
*. Fixed the issue of attributes not refreshing when switching characters;
*. Fixed the issue of incorrect material consumption during recruitment;
*. Fixed the healing amount error of the "Spring Surge" skill for the Rain Master;
*. Fixed the overflow error displayed during realm breakthroughs;
*. Fixed the issue of fire elementals not having attack animations;
*. Fixed the issue of displacing junior disciples after obtaining senior disciples;

【Optimizations】
*. Optimized some display effects;
*. Optimized some sound effects and performances;

We will continue to update and optimize the game during the New Release Festival, looking forward to polishing the journey with you and making it even more exciting! Thank you for your continuous support!

